<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Palaces</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Louis Tomlinson</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Palaces</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">0RUrteb0y55g9GPEGQN86S</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.500" end="00:21.750">It's not the same, not the same, but it's rainin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.750" end="00:24.910">The decorations are doin' my head in</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.910" end="00:28.370">There's somethin' strange, but familiar-tastin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.370" end="00:31.510">It pulls me in completely</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.510" end="00:34.560">On the high street, deep in the jungle</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.560" end="00:37.990">I see a face that I think I know</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.990" end="00:41.090">To the bar, through a tunnel of trouble</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.090" end="00:43.970">You pull me in</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.970" end="00:46.500">I, oh, l</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.500" end="00:51.330">I'm lost in the time, I don't care for the world outside</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.330" end="00:52.830">Oh, I</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.810" end="00:59.210">You can stay for the night in the palaces of my mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.210" end="01:05.980">You can stay for the night in the palaces of my mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.980" end="01:10.000" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(My mind)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.000" end="01:12.950">I can feel it, somethin' is happenin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.950" end="01:16.350">Is it attraction I'm overreactin' to?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.350" end="01:19.450">Either way, this is not how I planned it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.450" end="01:22.350">You pull me in completely</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.350" end="01:25.880">I can't drag myself from the oasis</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.880" end="01:29.120">Stop standin' still, everything's changin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.120" end="01:32.320">We've been written deep into the walls 'round here</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.320" end="01:35.130">It pulls me in</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.130" end="01:37.780">I, oh, I</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.780" end="01:42.530">I'm lost in the time, I don't care for the world outside</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.530" end="01:44.030">Oh, I</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.000" end="01:50.520">You can stay for the night in the palaces of my mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.520" end="01:57.130">You can stay for the night in the palaces of my mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.130" end="02:00.780" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(My mind)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.780" end="02:03.970">Every -k-up, every fight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.970" end="02:06.950">Kings and queens of borderlines</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.950" end="02:10.090">There's beauty in the scars tonight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.090" end="02:16.740">That's all I know</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.740" end="02:19.370">I, oh, I</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.370" end="02:24.170">I'm lost in the time, I don't care for the world outside</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.170" end="02:25.750">Oh, I</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:25.750" end="02:29.530">You can stay for the night in the palaces of my mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:29.530" end="02:32.150" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Every -k-up, every fight)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:32.150" end="02:35.950">You can stay for the night in the palaces of my mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:35.950" end="02:38.610" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Kings and queens and borderlines)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:38.610" end="02:41.560" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(My mind)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:41.560" end="02:45.560" /></div></body></tt>